           Recovery Manager fulfills a critical need in Microsoft
           enterprises for a more effective, more intelligent, and
           more precise approach to the recovery of downed systems
           and lost data, making your infrastructure more
           available, secure, and compliant. Intelligent Recovery
           enables ultra-rapid rollback of multiple damaged
           systems at speeds up to 90% faster than traditional
           restoration from tape or disk backup and reimaging,
           with zero data loss.

           Thereís a need in todayís organizations for a recovery
           solution that reduces recovery time, minimizes data
           loss, and delivers rapid return on investment. Recovery
           Managerís efficient, rapid rollbacks save staff time,
           end-user time and productivity, and system time, all
           while protecting your valuable data, even when that
           data is in an open or encrypted file.

           Cost effective Recovery Manager gives you the
           capability to recover from a wide array of problems
           with a single solution. You donít need to deploy
           separate solutions to handle software corruption and
           hardware failure: Recovery Manager can take it all in
           stride. When your software vendors release patches and
           updates, you can implement them without undue delay
           because you know that Recovery Manger will be covering
           your back, and giving you a sure and safe retreat if
           the updates are faulty.

           Downtime costs your enterprise real money in terms of
           productivity and total cost of ownership. Recovery
           Manager boosts availability by making sure that you can
           roll back systems within minutes, getting your
           employees up and running and doing their jobs in a
           fraction of the time of traditional backup and repair
           solutions.

           Dealing with, preventing infection from, and cleaning
           up after viruses and malware is a fact of life.
           Recovery Manager can make your infrastructure more
           secure from malware by allowing you to patch more
           quickly and without extensive testing, secure in the
           fact that you have a safe retreat if necessary. Closing
           the window of vulnerability between patch release and
           patch deployment significantly reduces your attack
           surface and secures your environment.

           A crucial aspect of regulatory compliance is
           maintaining an accurate and complete log of changes to
           systems containing protected data. Recovery Managerís
           crash analysis tools allow IT staff to compare side by
           side before and after snapshots of downed systems.

